  "keep-add-card-form-open-description": "Gbanyere: mgbe etinyechara kaadị, fọm ahụ na-anọgide na-emeghe na aha efu maka kaadị na-esote. Gbanyụrụ: fọm ahụ na-emechi ozugbo etinyere kaadị ahụ.",
  "title-bracket-label": "Gbanwee [aha] na mmalite aha kaadị ọhụrụ ka ọ bụrụ aha",
  "title-bracket-label-description": "Mgbe aha kaadị ọhụrụ malitere na [Ederede] ma ederede ọzọ sochiri ya, Ederede na-aghọ aha kaadị ahụ (a na-emepụta ya ma ọ bụrụ na bọọdụ enweghị nke nwere aha ahụ) ma wepụ ya n'aha. Agbanyụrụ: a na-ahapụ aha ahụ otú ọ dị.",
  "submit-on-enter": "Ziga ndị nchịkọta site na Enter",
